Package: fgof
Type: Package
Title: Fast Goodness-of-fit Test
Version: 0.2-2
Date: 2026-11-17
Author: Ivan Kojadinovic and Jun Yan
Maintainer: Jun Yan <jun.yan@uconn.edu>
Depends: mvtnorm, numDeriv
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Description: Goodness-of-fit test with multiplier or parametric
        bootstrap for continuous distributions with estimated parameters.
        Implements the procedures of Kojadinovic and Yan (2012)
        <doi:10.1002/cjs.11135>.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/jun-yan/fgof
BugReports: https://github.com/jun-yan/fgof/issues
